## Verification (run these, show output)

Never claim success without showing command output. Before considering any
change done, run:

- Tests: [EDIT: e.g. `npm test` / `pytest -q`]
- Lint: [EDIT: e.g. `npm run lint` / `ruff check .`]
- Types: [EDIT: e.g. `npm run typecheck` / `mypy src`]
- Build: [EDIT: e.g. `npm run build`]

## Review

- Reviewer instructions live in [REVIEW.md](REVIEW.md) — follow them for every review.
- Before opening a PR, run `/pre-pr` (checks + fresh-context review + security pass).
- Every review finding is fixed or resolved with a written reason; never merge
  with an open security finding.
- Risk tiers and required human approvals: see [docs/RISK_TIERS.md](docs/RISK_TIERS.md).
